1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,625
The massive, eight-spoked Academy ship orbits a shattered blue planet, surrounded by debris.

2
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:06,827
Golden energy crackles around it.

3
00:00:12,739 --> 00:00:15,266
Inside, a golden beam strikes a platform. The armored Isyander spreads his arms, his face a glowing red crystal.

4
00:00:21,378 --> 00:00:22,464
The golden beam shoots into the starry sky.

5
00:00:24,736 --> 00:00:26,117
Everything fades to a black starfield.

6
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:31,200
Four brilliant, star-like lights ignite within a colorful nebula.
